            "review_title": "Review at Tonkotsu Ramen Ichibanken",
            "review_text": "Dirk M\nTentlingen101 contributions\n0\nExcellent Ramen for a reasonable price\nJul 2025 • Solo\nI just discovered this place by chance, and had a very good lunch there. The speciality is, like the name says, Ramen, of which they have a large choice. I went there alone and then you sit on a \"bar\"-like situation at the wall, with small separations from the other guests. Which makes it pleasant. I can fully recommend it for lunch.\nWritten July 18, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
